s9-4-p13 : Block
s9-4-p13 = prose (cons "The relevant compilation relation of the chosen toolchain is explicit. It may initially be a stated assumption in an artifact's trusted dependencies. Lifting that compiler into the language makes its syntax, behavior, and transformations available to the same analysis, so a proof of its compilation relation replaces that assumption where established. This is the selected verification direction, rather than making bespoke x86, ARM, and other backend proofs prerequisites to using the system. Verified compilation has an established precedent in [18](#ref-18); no particular external compiler or configuration is silently selected or declared verified by this construction." nil)
